    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Elégance Canine is a grooming salon at 762 avenue de Tournamy, in the Tournamy shopping centre in Mougins. A presentation page for the salon describes grooming for dogs and cats: bath, nail and paw-pad trimming, hand-stripping, ear and eye cleaning, cut, trimming and clipping.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The same page announces opening Tuesday to Saturday from 9am to 7pm and on Monday from 2pm, with the phone number 06 77 63 85 21. It does not come from a website of the salon's own, and no price is given: it's best to call to confirm the hours, prices and whether your dog is accepted before coming.</p>
      <p>The company Elégance Canine, registered at this address, appears in a business register relayed by Le Figaro (SIREN 817 873 599), with a purpose of pet grooming and sale of accessories and a start of activity on 2 January 2016.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: call 06 77 63 85 21 before coming, as no official page of the salon confirms its hours.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The Tournamy shopping centre is on the avenue of the same name, in Mougins, in the Alpes-Maritimes.</p>
